OL,3,GNEWSA'People were screaming in pain'
OL,4,Aduring Co-op Live evacuation
OL,5,
OL,6,FRap music fans who were evacuated from
OL,7,Fa concert after an unknown substance
OL,8,Fwas released have said they started to
OL,9,F"cough and splutter" and some people
OL,10,Fwere "screaming in pain" and "coughing
OL,11,Fup blood".
OL,13,FSome 12,000 people were evacuated from
OL,14,FCo-op Live Arena after the incident at
OL,15,FUS rapper Don Toliver's show at the
OL,16,FCo-op Live in Manchester at about 22:00
OL,17,FGMT on Sunday.
OL,19,FOne person was taken to hospital, and
OL,20,Fmore than 80 were assessed by
OL,21,Fparamedics.
OL,23,APub: 23-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NW Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
